Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,No, she got overtaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:10.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Those guys are way too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.97,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Aw, she finished last.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Luck of the draw, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.64,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,We have to bid farewell \Nto everyone who lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:20.13,Broadcast,AO,0,0,0,,Winners, please move \Nto the waiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:24.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's still amazing that she got an invite \Nfrom such a big-name VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.80,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun helped her out, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He sure loves to poke his nose \Ninto everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:33.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He sent me like ten pamphlets \Nfor voice acting schools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:36.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He also scheduled \Nmy street performance without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:39.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,With that kind of zeal, \Nhe could be a stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:40.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:42.42,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.99,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:27.49,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,The lunch broadcast will have \Na new segment starting this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:28.97,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:30.79,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,I should clean my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:31.85,Main,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:35.79,Main,GIRL B,0,0,0,,Good luck, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:37.40,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:39.98,Main,COUNCIL BOY A,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the new segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:41.53,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:44.01,Main,TANAKA,0,0,0,,Won't you eat, Nene-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:45.71,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm dieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:49.58,Main,WAKAO,0,0,0,,You can do it, Nene-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.14,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,Break a leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.10,Main,FY GIRL A,0,0,0,,Inohana-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.51,Main,FY GIRL A,0,0,0,,Have some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.63,Main,FY GIRL B,0,0,0,,Snack on them during the broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:03.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:10.12,Main,FY GIRL C,0,0,0,,Iko-chan, the broadcast is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.87,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wonder what's for lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:24.84,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Dad went all-out, so I'm excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:31.50,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yikes, my stomach might rumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:34.06,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just eat a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:37.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You were smiling in your sleep. \NDid you have a nice dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.95,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:42.45,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:47.45,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is the broadcasting club \Nwith your lunch broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:51.58,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Exciting news! We're using \Nbrand-new equipment today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:55.50,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Did any of you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:57.61,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,There should be much less static now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:01.26,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We'll keep updating our content, too. \NLook forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:06.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's kick off our new segment: \NFour Friends Give Love Advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:10.37,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Our first message is from someone \Nwith the pen name "Nekko-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.48,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is easier on the ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.45,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,So soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:20.16,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"I think my boyfriend's been cheating, \Nbut I'm too scared to confront him."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.11,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,What a bummer of a topic to start with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Just dump him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:26.46,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hack into his phone and look through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.10,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Cheat on him as payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,How spiteful can you be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:33.48,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:38.73,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Peek at his phone, and if he is cheating, \Nget a new boyfriend and dump him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're the most spiteful one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.82,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,That's what makes Shinobu-chan great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:46.78,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to join them, Yamabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't happen to be \Nan expert on romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:52.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Even if I were there, \NI'd just be their hype man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:56.92,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Talk about first-world problems! \NI'd kill to be Shinobu-chan's hype man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:59.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't walk them \Nthrough everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Those four need to be able to \Ndo this on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:04.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:06.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let me go buy some dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.28,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Big eater, much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.74,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:11.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,On to our next message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:13.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's from "Itachi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.97,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"There's someone I'm interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Whenever we make eye contact, \Nthey bashfully turn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.22,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Does this mean I've got a shot?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, how bittersweet! Puppy love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:24.73,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Th-That's naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.73,0:05:26.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What do you think, Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:30.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Turn away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:31.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.41,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You've got a shot, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:54.03,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why are you blushing, Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.89,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I think you're jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:57.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Itachi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:00.20,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Keep us posted, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.09,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)\NTHE NEXT DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your \Nmessages today as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's start with "Itachi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:15.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"We made plans to go out for dinner. \NWhat should we get?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:18.09,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, making good progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:19.64,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You were right about having a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:22.90,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,They're going out for dinner already? \NThat's kinda naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.82,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Doesn't the love interest \Nseem sleazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:27.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What would be a good choice for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:28.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You need to show you have good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What's your pick, Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:33.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,If it were me, hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:40.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is my first time eating \Nokonomiyaki at a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.88,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,The thermal energy \Nof the griddle's scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:45.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You just need to flip it over \Nand sauce it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.86,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll flip it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:53.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:56.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're so silly, Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen, you can't be too rough with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:08.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Gently caress it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:11.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okonomiyaki, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:16.66,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Good idea, though. \NIt has entertainment value, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:20.06,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Iko-chan likes okonomiyaki, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.79,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,I'd love to go get some with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:29.42,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:29.42,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We've received another \Nmessage from Itachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"We've got the perfect mood \Ngoing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:35.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm so close! \NWhat should I do to seal the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:38.14,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous! I can't speak!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:39.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's so hype!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:43.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,They're doing something naughty \Nsomewhere in this school!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:45.60,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,How to seal the deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:48.65,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sounds like asking them out \Nwill do the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.86,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Too nervous to speak, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:53.35,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,You've got it in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:55.79,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,I bet my fried chicken on this going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:58.24,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The next move is a no-brainer, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:07:59.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:00.95,Main,RIKKANENE,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.33,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Just go for a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.33,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Just go for a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:04.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:04.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You can't just kiss someone, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:10.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Have you lost all sense of social norms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:13.93,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha? Just so you know, \NI'm talking about a kiss on the cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,And you, jumping right to a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Do you randomly cling to people \Nlike a bitch in heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:21.81,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hugging is how people greet \Neach other in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:24.00,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Same for cheek kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:28.18,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Shinobu, let's turn the mic off. \NI sense a catfight incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:32.34,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Calm down, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:35.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is getting a bit out of hand, \Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:38.92,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We can't give advice on stuff \Nwe have no experience with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.88,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I do have experience, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I do have experience, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.41,Main,IKOSHINOBU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:45.24,Main,IKOSHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well, um, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:46.71,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Way to fold, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My hug was effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.02,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So was my kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.96,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, you like hugs more, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:58.89,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You prefer a kiss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.18,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Which...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.85,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,...do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.16,Main,NENERIKKA,0,0,0,,Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Say, Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:12.41,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What makes you happier? A kiss or a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:14.74,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,She's still not backing down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:17.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:20.08,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We've turned the mic off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.58,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,The mic is still on, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.25,Main,GIRL D,0,0,0,,I knew Inohana-san and Himekawa-san \Nwould have the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:29.43,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,I want Rikka-chan to hug me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.21,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,I want a kiss from Nene-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:33.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sorry, I hit the wrong switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:35.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Shinobu, you big dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:38.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yikes, way to tank my image!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:42.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Let's end the broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:45.74,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But what about our advice \Nfor Itachi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:48.16,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Probably doesn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:51.57,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Ugh, what a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:54.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? What a pleasant surprise, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:58.04,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Would you let your beautiful \Nteacher vent for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:01.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't fix your makeup in our clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.78,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You know Samejima-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:06.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What, that muscles-with-limbs monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.69,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,We've been making more eye contact lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:11.80,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I kept turning away,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.62,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,but he suddenly invited me out \Nfor okonomiyaki yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:19.97,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I went, because free food, but he got\N this idea he had a real shot with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.72,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,When we were alone \Na few moments ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:29.50,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,he tried to kiss and hug me all \Nat once, so I kicked his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:32.14,Italics,IKO,0,0,0,,Dude, you were Itachi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:38.03,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,By the way, your broadcast \Nwas really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:41.09,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I never knew you girls \Nwere so experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:44.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea! \NThat was all lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.74,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Inohana isn't denying it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:49.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why aren't you saying anything, Rikka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:50.96,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Maybe they do need me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.96,Main,EPTITLE SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KISS OR HUG
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.54,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:11:00.42,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,Today's broadcasts \Nwere all a work of fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:06.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Any resemblance to actual persons, \Ngroups, or events is purely coincidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:10.74,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Well, we hope you have a good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:12.66,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:18.73,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Well, I don't really care \Nif you tank your image or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:21.08,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,but keep the romance \Ntalk on the down-low.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:25.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:26.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:27.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:30.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Right, I forgot. \NDo you have a minute, Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:34.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's plan out your next stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okie-dokie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:40.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is the errand boy \Ncalling her "Iko" lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:41.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nope, it's not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:44.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Those two have been pretty close lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.89,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Quite literally, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:46.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Next time—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:48.47,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, errand boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:49.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My name is Yamabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:53.03,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How come you're calling \NIko by her first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I didn't really notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:59.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We've spent much time together lately, \Nso I'm more casual around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:01.18,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Time together?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Kirino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:04.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was rude of me to use your first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:05.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:08.91,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:10.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll keep calling you Iko, then. \NIt's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:14.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:20.13,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll make \Na special exception for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:26.42,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'll let you call me N-Nene, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:30.35,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Because it's easier to say, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:33.82,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Himekawa is four syllables, \Nwhile Nene is only two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.56,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You'll save so much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:37.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:48.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Inohana. What's gotten into her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:49.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You can call me Rikka, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.92,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:58.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.92,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That tickles the ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:03.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Don't get flustered, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:05.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:10.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The way this is going, should I call you \Nby your first name too, Uzuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:15.18,Main,UZUKI,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass. \NIt's too embarrassing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.95,0:13:17.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:19.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Aww, look who just got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:20.81,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Stop that, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:24.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your face is all red. Do you have a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Should we cancel today's study session?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.79,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:32.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll see you at the usual diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:39.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Shinobu's been getting you to tutor her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.53,0:13:44.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It was Bucky's idea, \Nsince anchors need smarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:47.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Being tutored by the \Nerrand boy must be a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The answer for that is #2.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Look at the preposition again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:03.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. That was careless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:07.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,For long questions, first try \Nto find where the subject is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:12.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ignore the terms you don't know \Nand read the whole passage first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.11,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That sounds really crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I got lucky with really fresh fries. \NWant half?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:23.92,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm dieting, so I'll just have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:28.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you go in with your hand, you'll get \Noil all over your pen and notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:30.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:33.09,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Whoa, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:35.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly has the cleanest hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.85,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I, uh, just remembered \NI don't like fries that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:39.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:42.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka really loves the fries here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But if you don't want them, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.36,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Give me another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:55.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:04.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We all came here together once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:07.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It sucked when Nene stole my parfait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:14.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But Iko shared her ice cream \Nwith me to even it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:21.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is this about me calling \Nthe others by their first names?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.65,0:15:23.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you say so. I won't press you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:29.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you sure about me not using yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:32.87,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's fine. That would be unfair of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.50,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Now, why don't we call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.91,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The rain's not letting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:48.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Darn it! My umbrella \Ngot wrecked earlier, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:52.30,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sorry, you got held up because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'll share my umbrella to make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your grades have improved recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:09.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good to see you've \Nbeen hitting the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:12.06,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's because I have a good tutor, \NYamabuki-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:18.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If your grades keep improving, \Nyou won't need me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You're giving me too much credit, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.93,0:16:27.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You know, Yamabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:32.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I said no to being called Shinobu \Nbecause it'd be too embarrassing earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,but it's really because I'd feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:37.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm the only one out of the four of us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:39.44,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,who has a different \Nkind of dream, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:42.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Iko-chan's doing great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:44.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:48.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,At first, she couldn't emote on stream. \NThat was a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.35,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:55.09,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can tell what your viewers \Nwant to hear right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:59.06,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now, go end the stream on a good note.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.63,Flashback,IKON,0,0,0,,Forget-It-All Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was unfortunate how \Nthat collab event ended up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:27.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but she's trying a bunch of different \Nthings, which will help her grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.99,0:17:30.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nene-chan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:33.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's always business as usual, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:39.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I mean, she went and auditioned \Nbefore I even said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:42.78,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry for summoning you here."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.32,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's practicing in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:49.54,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,A soft, pleasant voice, much like \Na cat that wants some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.27,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,"Before you leave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:56.35,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,there is something I must tell you."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:54.00,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,It really does feel familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.56,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:58.75,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,However, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:01.51,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your acting downright sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:01.51,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,E-Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.09,Flashback,SEIRA,0,0,0,,...won't you tell me \Nthat you love me once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:08.49,Flashback Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I think and I think and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:14.69,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Y-Yep... I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:18.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her portrayal of things she's \Nunfamiliar with needs a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:20.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,when she does put in the work...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.64,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,I don't want to see your \Nstupid mug ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:26.78,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:31.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's capable of acting \Nthat chills yours truly to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I kinda want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:38.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Rikka-chan's made progress, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:41.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:46.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka became capable of \Nsinging her own songs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:48.76,Flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:52.56,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Why are you all here? \NWhere are the other spectators?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.11,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:55.22,Flashback,NENEIKO,0,0,0,,Rikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:55.22,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Rikka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:19:03.49,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA FTW - WE STAN INOHANA
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:19:01.22,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,You always put up a front \Nand never tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.49,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,You should at least vent to us sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:08.37,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:08.37,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,We kinda made these sloppy last-minute, \Nbut we'll do better when it's for reals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:12.62,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.37,0:19:12.62,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Imagine we're always in the front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:16.53,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Just look at us when it gets tough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.88,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:28.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't wait for her street performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.35,0:19:40.47,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They all took a step closer \Nto their dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:44.96,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That helped them get \Ncloser to you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:59.14,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The gap between us and our dreams \Nbecomes the gap between us and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:03.91,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Which means I'm dead last right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:09.18,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I mean, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:13.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.82,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:23.64,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm having so much fun \Nstudying with you every week
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:27.97,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,that I'm actually hoping \Nmy grades won't get better,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:30.75,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and I can keep studying with you \Ninstead of pursuing my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.04,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What a silly thing to wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:45.37,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Right now, "Uzuki" is good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.45,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,In return,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:51.33,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I want to enjoy these times \Nfor a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:55.31,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.81,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Actually, Yamabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:10.59,Italics,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If I can ever hold my head high \Nand say I'm chasing my dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:15.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If I can ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:22.86,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If I ever manage to make big \Nstrides towards my dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:36.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and stand alongside those three one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:39.30,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,When that time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:52.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,will you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:06.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,call me by my first name then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:09.96,Main,EPTITLE SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BLACK CATS AND WHITE DOGS
